      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "STAGE 1: Pattern Extraction\nDETERMINISTIC - No LLM\n\nVSCode Copilot Agent Mode:\n  Open: stage1_extraction/stage1_copilot_prompt.txt\n  Copy prompt -> Paste into Copilot Chat\n  Copilot reads all .sas + .log files\n  Copilot writes execution_trace.json\n\nExtracts:\n  - %macro, %include, DATA, PROC SQL\n  - RETAIN, BY variables\n  - Row counts, runtimes, warnings\n\nOutput: stage1_extraction/output/execution_trace.json",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "STAGE 1: Pattern Extraction\nDETERMINISTIC - No LLM\n\nVSCode Copilot Agent Mode:\n  Open: stage1_extraction/stage1_copilot_prompt.txt\n  Copy prompt -> Paste into Copilot Chat\n  Copilot reads all .sas + .log files\n  Copilot writes execution_trace.json\n\nExtracts:\n  - %macro, %include, DATA, PROC SQL\n  - RETAIN, BY variables\n  - Row counts, runtimes, warnings\n\nOutput: stage1_extraction/output/execution_trace.json",
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
