      "text": "STAGE 3: Self-Consistency Classifier\nSELF-CONSISTENCY\n\nONLY runs for patterns flagged as HIGH complexity\nin policy_registry.yaml (classifier: self_consistency)\n\nHOW TO RUN (single paste, no manual tallying):\n  1. Open your custom UI\n  2. Attach the .sas file\n  3. Open: stage2_4_prompts/prompt_3_self_consistency.txt\n  4. Paste the HIGH-complexity SAS block at the bottom\n  5. Send once\n\nWHAT THE LLM DOES INTERNALLY:\n  Runs 5 independent classifications itself\n  Tallies the votes\n  Returns a single JSON result:\n  {\n    \"decision\": \"ACCEPT\",\n    \"winning_pattern\": \"stateful_amortization_loop\",\n    \"tally\": {\"stateful_amortization_loop\": 4,\n              \"window_function_lag\": 1}\n  }\n\nDECISION RULES (applied by LLM automatically):\n  >= 4/5 agree  -> ACCEPT, proceed to Stage 4\n  <= 3/5 agree  -> ESCALATE to MCTS fallback\n\nOutput: Confirmed pattern name per ambiguous block",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "STAGE 3: Self-Consistency Classifier\nSELF-CONSISTENCY\n\nONLY runs for patterns flagged as HIGH complexity\nin policy_registry.yaml (classifier: self_consistency)\n\nHOW TO RUN (single paste, no manual tallying):\n  1. Open your custom UI\n  2. Attach the .sas file\n  3. Open: stage2_4_prompts/prompt_3_self_consistency.txt\n  4. Paste the HIGH-complexity SAS block at the bottom\n  5. Send once\n\nWHAT THE LLM DOES INTERNALLY:\n  Runs 5 independent classifications itself\n  Tallies the votes\n  Returns a single JSON result:\n  {\n    \"decision\": \"ACCEPT\",\n    \"winning_pattern\": \"stateful_amortization_loop\",\n    \"tally\": {\"stateful_amortization_loop\": 4,\n              \"window_function_lag\": 1}\n  }\n\nDECISION RULES (applied by LLM automatically):\n  >= 4/5 agree  -> ACCEPT, proceed to Stage 4\n  <= 3/5 agree  -> ESCALATE to MCTS fallback\n\nOutput: Confirmed pattern name per ambiguous block",
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
