      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PROMPT CATEGORIES\n\nPROMPT 1 - Column Graph Builder\n  Stage: 2a\n  Technique: Tree of Thought\n  Attach: .sas + execution_trace.json\n  Output: Dataset lineage DAG + variable dependency map (Markdown)\n  Next: Run Prompt 2\n\nPROMPT 2 - Pattern Discoverer\n  Stage: 2b\n  Technique: ToT + open-ended discovery\n  Attach: .sas + .log\n  Output: policy_registry.yaml with sas_code_block per pattern\n  Next: HIGH patterns -> Prompt 3 | All LOW/MEDIUM -> Prompt 4\n\nPROMPT 3 - Self-Consistency Classifier\n  Stage: 3\n  Technique: Self-Consistency (5 internal runs, auto-tallied)\n  Attach: policy_registry.yaml\n  Output: JSON with decision ACCEPT or ESCALATE TO MCTS per pattern\n  Next: ACCEPT -> Prompt 4 | ESCALATE -> MCTS 1\n\nPROMPT 4 - PySpark Code Generator\n  Stage: 4\n  Technique: Sequential Sampling (3 internal candidates, best selected)\n  Attach: policy_registry.yaml + Prompt 3 JSON output\n  Output: Production PySpark code with @checkpoint decorators\n  Next: Run Validation Engine -> 0 divergent rows = DONE | else Repair\n\nMCTS 1-4 - Fallback Loop\n  Stage: 3 fallback\n  Technique: Monte Carlo Tree Search (4-prompt loop)\n  Attach: policy_registry.yaml (MCTS 1), previous response (MCTS 2-4)\n  Output: Final PySpark method for the escalated pattern\n  Next: Integrate into pipeline -> Run Validation Engine\n\nREPAIR PROMPT - Patch Generator\n  Stage: 5\n  Technique: Sequential Sampling\n  Attach: diff report + failing PySpark file\n  Output: Minimal repair patch + explanation\n  Next: Apply patch -> Re-run Validation -> 0 divergent rows = DONE",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PROMPT CATEGORIES\n\nPROMPT 1 - Column Graph Builder\n  Stage: 2a\n  Technique: Tree of Thought\n  Attach: .sas + execution_trace.json\n  Output: Dataset lineage DAG + variable dependency map (Markdown)\n  Next: Run Prompt 2\n\nPROMPT 2 - Pattern Discoverer\n  Stage: 2b\n  Technique: ToT + open-ended discovery\n  Attach: .sas + .log\n  Output: policy_registry.yaml with sas_code_block per pattern\n  Next: HIGH patterns -> Prompt 3 | All LOW/MEDIUM -> Prompt 4\n\nPROMPT 3 - Self-Consistency Classifier\n  Stage: 3\n  Technique: Self-Consistency (5 internal runs, auto-tallied)\n  Attach: policy_registry.yaml\n  Output: JSON with decision ACCEPT or ESCALATE TO MCTS per pattern\n  Next: ACCEPT -> Prompt 4 | ESCALATE -> MCTS 1\n\nPROMPT 4 - PySpark Code Generator\n  Stage: 4\n  Technique: Sequential Sampling (3 internal candidates, best selected)\n  Attach: policy_registry.yaml + Prompt 3 JSON output\n  Output: Production PySpark code with @checkpoint decorators\n  Next: Run Validation Engine -> 0 divergent rows = DONE | else Repair\n\nMCTS 1-4 - Fallback Loop\n  Stage: 3 fallback\n  Technique: Monte Carlo Tree Search (4-prompt loop)\n  Attach: policy_registry.yaml (MCTS 1), previous response (MCTS 2-4)\n  Output: Final PySpark method for the escalated pattern\n  Next: Integrate into pipeline -> Run Validation Engine\n\nREPAIR PROMPT - Patch Generator\n  Stage: 5\n  Technique: Sequential Sampling\n  Attach: diff report + failing PySpark file\n  Output: Minimal repair patch + explanation\n  Next: Apply patch -> Re-run Validation -> 0 divergent rows = DONE",
